msgid "Godot Android library"
msgstr "Godot Android 函式庫"

msgid ""
"On Android platforms, the Godot Engine is designed as an `Android library "
"<https://developer.android.com/studio/projects/android-library>`_, enabling "
"several key features:"
msgstr ""
"在 Android 平台上，Godot 引擎設計為 `Android 函式庫 <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/projects/android-library>`_，因此具備下列重要功"
"能："

msgid ""
"Allows Godot Android projects to leverage components, libraries, and tools "
"from the Android, Java, and Kotlin ecosystems "
"via :ref:`doc_android_gradle_build`"
msgstr ""
"讓 Godot Android 專案透過 :ref:`doc_android_gradle_build` 使用 Android、Java "
"與 Kotlin 生態系中的元件、函式庫及工具。"

msgid "Provides the ability to make the engine portable and embeddable:"
msgstr "讓引擎具有可攜性及可嵌入性："

msgid ""
"Helps accelerate development and improve the capabilities of the :ref:`Godot "
"Android Editor <doc_using_the_android_editor>`"
msgstr ""
"有助於加快開發速度，並強化 :ref:`Godot Android 編輯器 "
"<doc_using_the_android_editor>` 的功能。"

msgid ""
"Allows the integration and reuse of the engine's capabilities within "
"existing codebases"
msgstr "允許將引擎的功能整合進既有程式碼庫並重複使用。"

msgid ""
"The Godot Android library is packaged as an AAR archive file and hosted on "
"`MavenCentral <https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.godotengine/"
"godot>`_ along with `its documentation <https://javadoc.io/doc/"
"org.godotengine/godot/latest/index.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Godot Android 函式庫以 AAR 封裝格式發佈，托管於 `MavenCentral <https://"
"central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.godotengine/godot>`_，同時提供 `API 文件 "
"<https://javadoc.io/doc/org.godotengine/godot/latest/index.html>`_。"

msgid ""
"It provides access to Godot APIs and capabilities for the following use-"
"cases."
msgstr "它提供下列使用情境所需的 Godot API 和功能。"

msgid "Godot Android plugins"
msgstr "Godot Android 外掛"

msgid ""
"Android plugins are tools to extend the capabilities of the Godot Engine by "
"tapping into the functionality provided by Android platforms and ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"Android 外掛可以透過 Android 平台及生態系提供的功能，擴充 Godot 引擎的能力。"

msgid ""
"An Android plugin is an Android library with a dependency on the Godot "
"Android library. The Godot Android library is used by the plugin to hook "
"into the engine's lifecycle and access the engine's APIs, granting it "
"capabilities used to update and customize the engine behavior as needed."
msgstr ""
"Android 外掛是依賴 Godot Android 函式庫的 Android 函式庫。外掛會利用 Godot "
"Android 函式庫連接引擎的生命週期並存取引擎 API，以便視需要更新及自訂引擎行"
"為。"

msgid ""
"For more information, see :ref:`Godot Android plugins <doc_android_plugin>`."
msgstr "詳情請參見 :ref:`Godot Android 外掛 <doc_android_plugin>`。"

msgid "Embedding Godot in existing Android projects"
msgstr "將 Godot 嵌入現有 Android 專案"

msgid ""
"The Godot Android library can be used to embed the Godot Engine within "
"Android applications or libraries, allowing developers to augment their "
"projects with the full capabilities of the engine."
msgstr ""
"Godot Android 函式庫可用來將 Godot 引擎嵌入 Android 應用程式或函式庫，讓開發"
"者能以引擎的完整功能強化其專案。"

msgid ""
"For more information, see :ref:`Embedding Godot in Android projects "
"<doc_embedding_in_android_projects>`."
msgstr ""
"詳情請參閱 :ref:`將 Godot 嵌入 Android 專案 "
"<doc_embedding_in_android_projects>`。"
